 "title": "Fractions, Decimals and Percentages",
 "summary": "See how one amount can be written in three different ways, then compare them with confidence.",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "Fractions, Decimals and Percentages are three different ways of expressing a part of a whole."
  },
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "We can convert between fractions, decimals and percentages."
  },
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "## Converting between Decimals and Percentages"
  },
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "To convert a decimal to a percentage we multiply by 100."
  },
  {
   "kind": "worked-example",
   "title": "Example 1: Convert 0.7 to a percentage",
   "steps": [
    {
     "heading": null,
     "body": "To convert a decimal to a percentage we multiply by 100.\n\n0.7 × 100 = 70  \n0.7 = 70%",
     "figure_refs": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "worked-example",
   "title": "Example 2: Convert 0.19 to a percentage",
   "steps": [
    {
     "heading": null,
     "body": "To convert a decimal to a percentage we multiply by 100.\n\n0.19 × 100 = 19  \n0.19 = 19%",
     "figure_refs": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "To convert a percentage to a decimal we divide by 100  \nDividing by 100 is the opposite of multiplying by 100"
  },
  {
   "kind": "worked-example",
   "title": "Example 3: Convert 25% to a decimal",
   "steps": [
    {
     "heading": null,
     "body": "To convert a percentage to a decimal we divide by 100.\n\n25 ÷ 100 = 0.25  \n25% = 0.25",
     "figure_refs": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "worked-example",
   "title": "Example 4: Convert 9% to a decimal",
   "steps": [
    {
     "heading": null,
     "body": "To convert a percentage to a decimal we divide by 100.\n\n9 ÷ 100 = 0.09  \n9% = 0.09",
     "figure_refs": []
    }
   ]
  },
