  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "To convert a decimal to a fraction we can convert it to a percentage (by multiplying by 100) and then write it is a fraction out of 100."
  },
  {
   "kind": "worked-example",
   "title": "Example 10: Convert 0.88 to a fraction. Give your answer in its simplest form.",
   "steps": [
    {
     "heading": null,
     "body": "To convert 0.88 to a percentage we multiply by 100.  \n0.88 × 100 = 88\n\n88% = 88⁄100\n\nWe can simplify our answer by dividing top and bottom by 4.\n\n88⁄100 = 22⁄25\n\n0.88 = 22⁄25",
     "figure_refs": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
